aiser/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/lake-home.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/lake-home-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/lake-home.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 360px" width="1200" height="784" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Codington County</small><h2>Watertown</h2><p>Tornadoes, Derecho winds, Hail</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/cities-we-serve/mitchell-appraiser/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/grain-bins.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/grain-bins-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/grain-bins.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 360px" width="1200" height="568" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Davison County</small><h2>Mitchell</h2><p>Tornadoes, Hail, Straight-line wind</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/cities-we-serve/yankton-appraiser/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/river-storm.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/river-storm-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/river-storm.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 360px" width="1200" height="778" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Yankton County</small><h2>Yankton</h2><p>River flooding, Hail, Severe wind</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/cities-we-serve/pierre-appraiser/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/river-bluffs.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/river-bluffs-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/river-bluffs.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 360px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Hughes County</small><h2>Pierre</h2><p>Large hail, Prairie wind, River flooding</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/cities-we-serve/huron-appraiser/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/prairie-storm.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/prairie-storm-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/prairie-storm.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 360px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Beadle County</small><h2>Huron</h2><p>Hail, Tornadoes, James River flooding</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/cities-we-serve/spearfish-appraiser/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/spearfish-canyon.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/spearfish-canyon-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/spearfish-canyon.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 360px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Lawrence County</small><h2>Spearfish</h2><p>Wildfire &amp; smoke, Heavy snow, Hail</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/cities-we-serve/vermillion-appraiser/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/river-flood.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/river-flood-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/river-flood.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 360px" width="1200" height="699" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Clay County</small><h2>Vermillion</h2><p>River flooding, Hail, Severe wind</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/cities-we-serve/sturgis-appraiser/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/sturgis-main.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/sturgis-main-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/sturgis-main.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 360px" width="1024" height="774" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Meade County</small><h2>Sturgis</h2><p>Hail, Wildfire &amp; smoke, High wind</p></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><p class="kicker">Regions</p><h2>How claims differ across South Dakota</h2><p>The same policy language plays out very differently in a Sioux Falls subdivision, a James Valley farmstead and a cabin above Spearfish.</p></div><div class="region-row rv"><div class="region-row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/sioux-falls.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/sioux-falls-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/sioux-falls.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div><p class="kicker">East River</p><h3>Sioux Empire &amp; Southeast</h3><p>The most populated corner of the state, from Sioux Falls and Brookings down to Yankton and Vermillion. Hail and wind claims dominate, the 2019 Sioux Falls tornadoes and the 2022 derecho are still fresh, and the Big Sioux River and Missouri River bring flood questions to low ground.</p></div></div><div class="region-row rv"><div class="region-row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/prairie-farm.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/prairie-farm-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/prairie-farm.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div><p class="kicker">East River</p><h3>Glacial Lakes &amp; James Valley</h3><p>Flat farmland, glacial lakes and long open stretches around Aberdeen, Watertown, Huron and Mitchell. Blizzards pack snow onto roofs, summer storms hammer steel buildings, and tornado history runs from Spencer to Delmont.</p></div></div><div class="region-row rv"><div class="region-row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/river-bluffs.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/river-bluffs-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/river-bluffs.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div><p class="kicker">The middle</p><h3>Missouri River Country</h3><p>Pierre, Fort Pierre and the long Missouri River reservoirs, where East River meets West River. The country’s largest recorded hailstone fell near Vivian, and the 2011 river flood reached homes in the capital.</p></div></div><div class="region-row rv"><div class="region-row-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/black-hills.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/black-hills-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/black-hills.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 300px" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div><p class="kicker">West River</p><h3>Black Hills &amp; West River</h3><p>Rapid City, Spearfish, Sturgis and the ranch country beyond. Ponderosa forests bring wildfire risk, storms off the Hills drop big hail, and early blizzards like the 2013 storm can bury roofs in feet of wet snow.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="strip"><div class="wrap strip-in rv"><div><h2>Don’t see your town?</h2><p>We cover every South Dakota county. Call and tell us where the property is.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn ink" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn line" href="/get-a-claim-review/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
